#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kpercentage; is a small math application that will help pupils to improve "
"their skills in calculating percentages. <inlinemediaobject> <imageobject> "
"<imagedata fileref=\"edu-logo.png\" format=\"PNG\"/> </imageobject> "
"</inlinemediaobject> &kpercentage; is part of the KDE-EDU Project: <ulink "
"url=\"http://edu.kde.org/\">http://edu.kde.org/</ulink>"
msgstr ""
"&kpercentage; é un pequeno programa de matemáticas que lle permite aos "
"alunos mellorar as suas habilidades de cálculo de porcentaxes. <inlinemediaobject>"
"<imageobject><imagedata fileref=\"edu-logo.png\" format=\"PNG\"/></imageobject></inlinemediaobject> &kpercentage; forma parte "
"do proxecto Educativo de KDE: <ulink url=\"http://edu.kde.org/\">http://edu.kde.org/</ulink>"

